1
00:01:48,725 --> 00:01:50,725


2
00:01:50,749 --> 00:01:52,669
Now, before we begin today's story,

3
00:01:52,693 --> 00:01:54,560
let me refresh your memory on what happened last time.

4
00:01:55,074 --> 00:01:57,466
Duralumin, a pawn of the X-Union,

5
00:01:57,490 --> 00:01:59,762
finally revealed his traitorous nature and

6
00:01:59,787 --> 00:02:02,700
tried to kill the King, Queen, and Sapphire.

7
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:05,505
However, betrayed by Nylon,

8
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:09,139
Duralumin met a swift end, and the crown fell into Nylon's hands.

9
00:02:09,655 --> 00:02:13,700
As the king of Silverland, Nylon welcomed X-Union into the castle.

10
00:02:14,113 --> 00:02:17,521
Meanwhile, Sapphire bade farewell to her parents in the Skull Chamber

11
00:02:17,545 --> 00:02:21,106
and escaped the castle with three orbs—gold, silver, and bronze—

12
00:02:21,131 --> 00:02:23,020
believed to hold the power to protect the kingdom.

13
00:02:23,626 --> 00:02:25,880
She ran to seek help from Prince Franz.

14
00:02:25,904 --> 00:02:26,692
However,

15
00:02:27,904 --> 00:02:32,900
the King and Queen were executed on Skull Island by the X-Union.

16
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:51,864
Three orbs...

17
00:02:51,888 --> 00:02:54,140
What power do you truly hold?

18
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:57,737
If you really have power, please help Sapphire now!

19
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:15,322
Poor Sapphire...

20
00:03:16,140 --> 00:03:18,940
Heavenly Father, I'll do anything.

21
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:22,200
So please, make Sapphire happy.

22
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:32,820
What's that sound of bells?

23
00:03:35,124 --> 00:03:36,474
Please stop!

24
00:03:37,537 --> 00:03:38,497
Stop it!

25
00:03:38,623 --> 00:03:40,147
Please stop!

26
00:03:42,563 --> 00:03:44,294
Please stop!

27
00:03:45,638 --> 00:03:47,620
Stop! Stop it! Please stop!

28
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:51,317
Have you lost your mind, Nylon?

29
00:03:52,615 --> 00:03:53,381
What's wrong?

30
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,363
I've learned the truth about those bells.

31
00:03:56,644 --> 00:04:00,160
The people are ringing them to mourn the executed King and Queen.

32
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,220
What!?

33
00:04:02,270 --> 00:04:06,200
Destroy every bell in the kingdom! And capture Sapphire immediately!

34
00:04:06,665 --> 00:04:09,020
Find her, no matter where she hides!

35
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,840
Tear down mountains if you must!

36
00:04:11,488 --> 00:04:15,040
Destroy every possible place Sapphire could be hiding!

37
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:53,653
We can't even hear the bells anymore...

38
00:04:53,677 --> 00:04:55,960
and we've got no food or place to live.

39
00:04:56,110 --> 00:04:58,620
Where on earth did Princess Sapphire go?

40
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:02,640
The King and Queen have gone to heaven, too.

41
00:05:03,045 --> 00:05:06,639
But Sapphire is fine, so I'm relieved.

42
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:09,039
Is it ready yet, Tink?

43
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,866
Not yet, not yet!

44
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:40,780
Kuro no Ojisan is on lookout duty!

45
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:45,105
Alright, Hotoru-kun, I'm counting on you!

46
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:51,768
Ahem!

47
00:05:51,792 --> 00:05:54,581
Here's a gift for the two of you from our forest friends!

48
00:05:54,605 --> 00:05:55,308
Here you go!

49
00:06:02,805 --> 00:06:04,206
How beautiful!

50
00:06:04,567 --> 00:06:05,534
It's lovely!

51
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:32,870
Sapphire!

52
00:06:32,894 --> 00:06:35,569
Do you like our present?

53
00:06:36,475 --> 00:06:37,628
Thank you, Tink!

54
00:06:37,652 --> 00:06:38,720
It's wonderful!

55
00:06:38,944 --> 00:06:39,635
See?

56
00:06:39,659 --> 00:06:41,292
I'm so glad you like it!

57
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:44,540
In that case, here's a little bonus!

58
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,400
Hit it!

59
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:34,540
Sapphire!

60
00:07:43,410 --> 00:07:44,909
I'm sorry, Tink.

61
00:07:44,933 --> 00:07:46,380
Crying at a time like this...

62
00:07:48,030 --> 00:07:49,807
Sapphire really is a coward.

63
00:07:49,831 --> 00:07:53,480
No matter how hard I try to be brave, I'm still so sad.

64
00:07:58,390 --> 00:08:02,460
I just want to see my mother and father... one more time.

65
00:08:08,355 --> 00:08:09,424
So that's what happened.

66
00:08:09,972 --> 00:08:11,920
Sapphire was enduring it all this time.

67
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:25,060
Heavenly Father, I'll endure whatever painful trials come my way.

68
00:08:25,713 --> 00:08:28,198
So please grant my prayer.

69
00:08:29,066 --> 00:08:31,340
Give Sapphire her mother and father back.

70
00:08:32,015 --> 00:08:33,721
Please bring them back to life.

71
00:08:34,269 --> 00:08:36,472
 I beg you, hear my wish.

72
00:08:50,554 --> 00:08:51,887
Heavenly Father!

73
00:08:52,449 --> 00:08:53,088
Tink,

74
00:08:53,112 --> 00:08:55,549
 as a former angel,

75
00:08:55,573 --> 00:08:59,560
you know wishes aren't granted simply by speaking them.

76
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,284
If you wish to save those you love,

77
00:09:02,308 --> 00:09:06,320
work for them with all your strength and all your heart.

78
00:09:07,309 --> 00:09:08,760
I shall watch over you from here.

79
00:09:09,585 --> 00:09:13,880
Whether your wish is granted depends entirely on your efforts.

80
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,760
I'll do it!

81
00:09:16,285 --> 00:09:19,340
For Sapphire's sake, I'll do anything, no matter how hard!

82
00:09:26,626 --> 00:09:27,909
Wow, incredible!

83
00:09:27,933 --> 00:09:29,018
Thanks so much.

84
00:09:29,042 --> 00:09:30,507
Sapphire will be so happy.

85
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:35,431
Who brought this?

86
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:39,000
The little mouse brought it.

87
00:09:39,659 --> 00:09:41,320
But you can't eat this.

88
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:42,980
Oh, I know!

89
00:09:43,195 --> 00:09:44,680
We can ring the bell with this!

90
00:09:44,905 --> 00:09:47,057
I'll ring the bell to wake Sapphire up.

91
00:09:48,115 --> 00:09:49,051
Opal!

92
00:09:50,619 --> 00:09:54,060
Sapphire kept those three orbs put away so carefully!

93
00:09:54,905 --> 00:09:56,996
But can't you give it back to me just for a moment?

94
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:01,095
I want to ring the bell with it and wake Sapphire up.

95
00:10:02,201 --> 00:10:04,032
I'll be careful not to break it.

96
00:10:05,140 --> 00:10:06,900
Thank you!

97
00:10:11,149 --> 00:10:13,080
Okay, I'm gonna ring it!

98
00:10:31,209 --> 00:10:32,700
It started ringing all by itself!

99
00:10:32,828 --> 00:10:34,323
You attached the three jewels.

100
00:10:34,730 --> 00:10:37,409
Those three jewels really do have a mysterious power.

101
00:10:37,433 --> 00:10:42,500
Legend says they protect the people, the royal family, and Silverland.

102
00:10:53,445 --> 00:10:54,560
Wow, it's a bell!

103
00:11:07,249 --> 00:11:08,042
What happened?

104
00:11:08,495 --> 00:11:10,800
I thought I told you to demolish all the bells!

105
00:11:10,865 --> 00:11:13,114
Well, sir... the cause is completely unknown.

106
00:11:19,154 --> 00:11:19,784
Shut up!

107
00:11:19,808 --> 00:11:21,845
Stop hesitating and smash it!

108
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:42,140
What a wonderful thing!

109
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,120
My arms are itching for action!

110
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:47,544
I'm not gonna just stand around sulking either!

111
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,354
Sapphire, it's time to fight!

112
00:11:49,378 --> 00:11:51,943
We're driving X out of Silverland!

113
00:11:54,889 --> 00:11:56,620
Thank you, everyone!

114
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,960
It's X!

115
00:12:05,599 --> 00:12:07,460
I've been waiting for you, X!

116
00:12:07,559 --> 00:12:09,549
We've got our mysterious friend on our side!

117
00:12:09,573 --> 00:12:10,760
Lets go, guys!

118
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,917
 Opal, we're counting on you!

119
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:17,060
Lets go!

120
00:12:31,909 --> 00:12:33,198
Big brothers!

121
00:12:33,222 --> 00:12:36,695
 Ring louder and louder!

122
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:50,060
Fools! Did you think you could defeat the X Army?!

123
00:12:50,269 --> 00:12:51,269
Advance!

124
00:12:58,189 --> 00:12:59,740
Trample them!

125
00:13:43,158 --> 00:13:44,790
What a powerful force!

126
00:13:45,558 --> 00:13:46,245
Oh no!

127
00:13:59,499 --> 00:14:00,499
Serves you right!

128
00:14:11,105 --> 00:14:11,995
Tink!

129
00:14:13,625 --> 00:14:14,994
Got 'em! They're safe!

130
00:14:19,139 --> 00:14:20,139
Hey, in here!

131
00:14:20,163 --> 00:14:21,895
We're saved! We made it!

132
00:14:35,649 --> 00:14:37,458
Damn it! We're trapped!

133
00:14:39,612 --> 00:14:41,067
Are we going to miss dinner?!

134
00:14:41,290 --> 00:14:43,779
Look, I know the exit to this cave.

135
00:14:43,803 --> 00:14:46,000
It comes out right next to the castle.

136
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,280
I see.

137
00:14:48,319 --> 00:14:48,910
Alright!

138
00:14:49,419 --> 00:14:50,162
Hurry!

139
00:14:50,186 --> 00:14:53,818
Someone, find me a
weapon—anything will do!

140
00:14:53,842 --> 00:14:56,360
I'm going to take it
and storm the castle!

141
00:14:56,705 --> 00:14:59,320
That's it! We can make them using the three orbs.

142
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:00,265
That's right!

143
00:15:00,380 --> 00:15:02,740
We're the top woodworkers in the world!

144
00:15:02,764 --> 00:15:03,987
 I see. Thank you!

145
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,388
Tink should have those three orbs!

146
00:15:06,412 --> 00:15:07,252
Where is he?

147
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:09,971
Tink!

148
00:15:09,996 --> 00:15:11,971
Where are you?

149
00:15:11,995 --> 00:15:13,323
Tink!

150
00:15:16,935 --> 00:15:18,500
It's so hard...

151
00:15:23,166 --> 00:15:25,545
It's no use...

152
00:15:25,717 --> 00:15:27,080
Tink! There you are!

153
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:28,713
Tink, hang in there.

154
00:15:29,217 --> 00:15:29,897
Tink!

155
00:15:33,883 --> 00:15:34,680
Sapphire!

156
00:15:34,719 --> 00:15:38,443
I was making a weapon with the orbs to protect Sapphire.

157
00:15:38,467 --> 00:15:39,605
Thank you, Tink.

158
00:15:40,225 --> 00:15:43,420
Now then, time to show of our skills as blacksmiths!

159
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,403
Alright!

160
00:16:03,291 --> 00:16:04,440
It's done!

161
00:16:07,889 --> 00:16:09,500
This power is incredible!

162
00:16:09,580 --> 00:16:10,513
Tink, look.

163
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:11,308
What's that!

164
00:16:11,396 --> 00:16:12,989
We made it from the leftover metal!

165
00:16:13,013 --> 00:16:15,794
I'm sure this horn has the same power as those metal orbs.

166
00:16:15,818 --> 00:16:17,700
Blow it for us!

167
00:16:17,724 --> 00:16:18,255
Okay.

168
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:22,986
Everyone, please wait here.

169
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,680
Sapphire!

170
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:30,716
Girls stay back!

171
00:16:30,889 --> 00:16:32,180
Leave this to me!

172
00:16:32,555 --> 00:16:33,555
Franz?

173
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,869
Hyah!

174
00:16:41,408 --> 00:16:42,080
Sapphire!

175
00:16:42,990 --> 00:16:44,029
Forgive me, Franz!

176
00:16:44,467 --> 00:16:47,640
I can't let you put yourself in danger!

177
00:16:49,555 --> 00:16:50,980
That's Sapphire! Fire!

178
00:17:04,809 --> 00:17:05,839
Sapphire!

179
00:17:07,974 --> 00:17:08,980
Sapphire!

180
00:17:10,568 --> 00:17:11,206
Franz!

181
00:17:11,230 --> 00:17:13,120
I'm fine! Quick, run!

182
00:17:36,909 --> 00:17:38,480
It's the mysterious power of the Royal Orb!

183
00:17:38,739 --> 00:17:41,320
Sapphire! Now is the time to crush X!

184
00:17:41,629 --> 00:17:43,540
Yay! We did it! We did it!

185
00:17:51,779 --> 00:17:53,480
Curse you, Sapphire...

186
00:18:09,780 --> 00:18:10,780
Sapphire!

187
00:18:13,549 --> 00:18:14,407
X!

188
00:18:14,432 --> 00:18:15,920
Now is the time of your demise!

189
00:18:16,404 --> 00:18:17,920
So you are Sapphire?

190
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:37,920
Sapphire!

191
00:18:38,010 --> 00:18:40,010


192
00:18:51,389 --> 00:18:54,740
Heavenly Father! Please save Sapphire!

193
00:19:01,749 --> 00:19:02,984
We did it, Sapphire!

194
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,020
Watch out!

195
00:19:35,658 --> 00:19:36,361
Tink!

196
00:19:39,861 --> 00:19:41,939
It's the end of Nylon!

197
00:19:51,659 --> 00:19:53,040
Tink! Tink!

198
00:19:58,549 --> 00:19:59,228
Tink!

199
00:19:59,377 --> 00:20:00,188
Tink!

200
00:20:00,751 --> 00:20:01,641
Don't die!

201
00:20:01,979 --> 00:20:02,840
You can't die!

202
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:07,100
Sapphire, it's time for us to say goodbye.

203
00:20:07,157 --> 00:20:08,845
Father in Heaven is calling me.

204
00:20:08,869 --> 00:20:10,267
 I have to go back.

205
00:20:10,291 --> 00:20:12,700
No! I don't want to say goodbye, Tink!

206
00:20:13,729 --> 00:20:14,892
Father in Heaven,

207
00:20:14,916 --> 00:20:17,060
I did my best for Sapphire.

208
00:20:17,654 --> 00:20:20,013
Will you grant my wish?

209
00:20:21,629 --> 00:20:22,592
Very well, Tink.

210
00:20:23,272 --> 00:20:24,900
I shall grant your wish.

211
00:20:25,839 --> 00:20:28,860
I will send Sapphire's father and mother back to her.

212
00:20:29,659 --> 00:20:35,280
And I will take away the boy's heart that you wrongfully gave to Sapphire.

213
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:38,369
Thank you, Father.

214
00:21:21,334 --> 00:21:22,334
Mother!

215
00:21:22,381 --> 00:21:23,516
Father!

216
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:24,235
Sapphire!

217
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,300
Sapphire!

218
00:21:25,789 --> 00:21:27,335
Mother!

219
00:22:12,904 --> 00:22:15,358
I'm Tink, back to being an angel!

220
00:22:15,704 --> 00:22:18,080
What became of Silverland after that?

221
00:22:18,594 --> 00:22:20,600
What happened to Sapphire and Franz?

222
00:22:21,154 --> 00:22:22,825
You all want to know, don't you?

223
00:22:24,279 --> 00:22:28,040
Silverland has returned to the beautiful kingdom it once was.

224
00:22:55,859 --> 00:22:57,560
Did you get the plan ready for tonight?

225
00:23:05,569 --> 00:23:07,195
Sorry to keep you waiting!

226
00:23:14,239 --> 00:23:17,740
They say Sapphire and Franz are getting married soon.

227
00:23:18,539 --> 00:23:21,920
I'm sure they'll make a wonderfully happy couple.

228
00:23:22,639 --> 00:23:25,758
And I'll be attending the wedding when they do!

229
00:24:06,704 --> 00:24:08,704

